OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of rain continue
OL,6,Facross northern areas, with some heavy
OL,7,Fbursts possible in Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fand western Scotland. Elsewhere, it
OL,9,Fstays dry with sunny spells. The
OL,10,Fsunniest conditions are expected in
OL,11,Fthe south, where it will feel hot and
OL,12,Fhumid.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FCloudy across the northwest,
OL,15,Fwith a chance of rain. Dry across much
OL,16,Fof England and Wales with clear
OL,17,Fspells, and a few isolated mist and
OL,18,Ffog patches. Another warm night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
